    "One restaurant per cart. Conflict modal is mandatory.",
    "Online payment is always disabled ('Coming soon').",
    "Delivery fee ₹29, tax 5%.",
    "Customer app rejects non-USER roles.",
    "Dark mode is forced OFF (html.light, class dark removed)."
